# --- Citation information (README.md "Contents") ---

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Framework for R analysis projects"
message: "If you publish results obtained with this template, please cite it using the information below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Imai"
    given-names: "Kei"
    email: "keiimai1220@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "The University of Tokyo, Japan"
abstract: >-
  A template for starting research projects.
  It holds the directory structure, the license, record templates (the record of decisions, citation information, where data goes) and a reproducibility recording layer. For each run, the recording layer keeps the run_id, the SHA-256 of the files read, the git commit, a snapshot of the runtime environment, the settings used, the SHA-256 of the outputs, and a ledger of all runs. It has no runtime environment and does not depend on the R version. No analysis code is bundled.
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - R
